## Assignment:
`BaseVideo` is already defined for you. Create `PremiumVideo` that extends `BaseVideo` and adds `adFree` (boolean). Create a PremiumVideo called `overpriced` with any values you want. (Don't worry about the red squiggles under `BaseVideo`, it will be defined at runtime for you, but TS won't know about it till you run)

